{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"1日遅れたごめんね←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあや(和田まあやchan)お誕生日おめでとう!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"14歳うあおっ(・o・ノ)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもまあやらしさを大切に、まあやパワー全開でいてね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素直でストレートで、誰にでも優しくて、いつも笑顔なまあや。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなまあやが大好きや(o>ω<o)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしくね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長いこと更新できんかったあ('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ひめたんが何してたか、わかるよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなひめきゅんだもーんね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい調子のりました←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というわけで説明します"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日曜日は横浜に遊び行ってきた!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クルーズしよってままに誘われて行ったんだけど、結局雨降ってまた後日..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まま、天気予報は見てこうね。うん寒かった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中華街行って赤レンガ行ってワールドポーターズ行っておとなしく帰ってきた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ね?結構満喫してるっしょ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうなの楽しかったの(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まま横浜大好きでね、地元に住んでる時から旅行にもよく来てたの横浜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残念ながらクルーズ出来んかったけど、またいつか連れてってもらうから大丈夫。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうせならあったかい時のがいいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/24/7908595/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せや(ω)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前のまりか(伊藤万理華chan)ブログでひめたんのこと書いてくれとったけ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はお返しにひめたんがまりかのこと書いちゃる♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかまりか(o>ω<o)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"万理華とひめか、誕生日ちょっとしか変わらんの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"万理華と写真撮る時は、いっつもひめたんの顔がくしゃってなる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/24/7908595/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「にいーっ。」て笑う万理華は癒しやねん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑顔で誰かを幸せにできるのって素敵だよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ま、それがアイドルとして在るべき姿だって知ってるけどさ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも万理華のブログの写真一枚笑顔なだけで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか心がほっこりするじゃない(^^)?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それからっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やるときはやる子!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全体のモチベーションをアップしてくれるのもやっぱり万理華。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リーダーシップを発揮して引っ張ってくれる時もあれば"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"健気に何度も試行錯誤して技を身に付けようって頑張ってる時もある。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冒険するの好きなんだろうなって思う!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは、好きなものはとことん好きなんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"苦手なものは手つけようとしないからさー、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"万理華のそーゆーこと尊敬します(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"万理華の私服可愛い!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"万理華の関西弁可愛い!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"万理華のお絵かき可愛い!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さらに2ndの個人PVの可愛さがやばいねんっ//"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"万理華ー好きやー(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んで昨日今日は学校の合宿行ってまーした!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんね更新できなくて。ごめんねーごめんなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/24/7908595/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島では、やっぱり武将って言ったら毛利元就なのかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな武将っている?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは毛利さんもだけど、平清盛さんも尊敬しますよ(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん宮島の真っ赤な鳥居を見てごらんなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/24/7908595/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何か決め事ってある!?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/24/7908595/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲン担ぎとかするの?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のーっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぱんぱんぱんっぎゅっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぱんぱんぱんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぱんぱんぱんっぎゅ〜っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せーのっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"努力!感謝!笑顔!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うちらは乃木坂上り坂!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"46!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いえーい＼(^O^)／☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/24/7908595/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"茶髪と黒髪どっちが好きー?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/24/7908595/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男の人の髪は短い方が好き?それとも長い方が好き?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そーゆーのはあんまよくわかんないかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似合ってればどんな髪したって素敵なはず(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/24/7908595/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『スウィーツ男子』ひめたん的どう思う?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんと気が合うじゃないですかー♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいいかわいーい!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/24/7908595/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今一番旅行しに行きたい場所はどこ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こりあ(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/24/7908595/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎回ひめたんに質問しようと思っても、なかなかいいネタが浮かばない..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかいい質問ありますか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/24/7908595/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"回答してもらうにはどんな質問したらいいんやろう(--;)?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/24/7908595/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな質問したら採用されますか教えてください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/24/7908595/0005.g